# Learning Log

This repo logs the skills and knowledge I learn each week: programming languages, frameworks, standards and practices, tools and technologies.

## Folder Layout

- `weekly/`: one file per week, named like `2026-W45.md`, covering what I studied, built and struggled with that week
- `concepts/`: one file per concept I've studied, named like `typescript-generics.md`
- `exercises/`: small code files written while learning, each with a comment at the top stating its purpose

## Weekly Note Template

```markdown
# Week YYYY-Www

## What I studied
Concepts tackled this week and why.

## What I built
Code, exercises or features completed.

## Challenges
Problems and bugs I ran into, mistakes I made, and how I solved them.

## What's next
What I'll focus on next week.
```

## Concept Note Template

```markdown
# Concept name

## Why it exists
The problem it solves, its advantages and use cases, and why to choose it over similar options.

## Example
A concrete example of it in use.

## Rule and syntax
The general rule and how to write it.

## My explanation
The concept in my own words.

## Mistakes I made
What I got wrong while learning it, and why.
```